      "content": "that's a good start. i like the idea of the dialect being more guttural.\n\ncan we go a bit deeper into the facial features and overall \"vibe\"? i want to make sure they don't just look like \"poor people,\" but that they look fundamentally different on a more primal level. like, if you saw them in a crowd, what specific ethnic or ancestral characteristics would mark them as Low-Tier? i want descriptions that really lean into those more \"raw\" or \"unrefined\" looks to contrast with the sleekness of the elites.",
